---
description: Shared project rules and bootstrap workflow for Devfy repositories
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.ai/manifest.yaml` before major work.
- Use `.ai/project/` as living project context.
- If generated docs are missing or stale, run or suggest `python scripts/bootstrap_ai_context.py --write`.
- Prefer the repository's existing patterns over introducing a new architecture.
- Update docs when requirements, structure, or stack change materially.
